# BM903's leg-0 handoff dumps are rung9's capture OUTPUTS, and the repo's root
# .gitignore excludes *.bin. BM602's B+ half compares its executed handoff
# against those exact bytes, so the pinned copies under evidence/refs/ have to
# be tracked -- a reference a clean checkout cannot see is a check that
# silently stops existing. Negation, not `git add -f`, so the exception survives
# the next `git add`. Same convention as ../rung6_5/.gitignore.
!/evidence/refs/*.bin
